
Tracing level reset from 0 to 1.

Solving sin(150 - x) = 2 * sin(x - 30) for x

Tidying to sin(150 + -1 * x) + -2 * sin(-30 + x) = 0

Expanding and collecting terms gives

(3/2) * cos(x) + (-2 * cos(-30) + -1 * cos(150)) * sin(x) = 0

tan(x) = - (cos(150) * -1 + cos(-30) * -2) / (3/2) 

	Letting n1 denote an arbitrary integer
    x = arctan((2/3) * (2 * cos(-30) + 1 * cos(150))) + 180 * n1
     (by Isolation)

